{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1318,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46925e3969d4e4bd7846e68c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天早上我花了一点工夫准备！\r\n因为我的手不习惯绑辫子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2322beb039ee3071c0f9236c408ce069eabc3c676e099545b0abb92811a2d23d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36799fcb54cf80c58eea5b33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐要吃什么好呢？\r\n我现在有股莫名想吃西红柿意大利面，\r\n或是西红柿酱炒饭的心情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0083c2c142fe65fe594d314d0e8d4bfd467092003ec1012ac685237be8055f5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd927eceb6aa7dd1a955fc4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上练跑也能放心！\r\n腰带上的星星这么耀眼，\r\n一定会替我照亮夜晚的道路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcb5bd6e3693d11c08b92000ef56b69414a88b620aaafde4dab2b0b0736b533e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac2b4b4f37ec32db3eff836d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到春天，就是在感谢祭上让新生\r\n看到我这个班长活跃的好机会！\r\n来，看我大展身手吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c2137270d5a70e821792cd5f043275253a89cf1ff994781f8293e52e8615831",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dac8a878f552bca03fd7a88b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是到海边或山上，这个颜色\r\n都很醒目！不会找不到班长，\r\n大家想必很放心吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e5d8670ccd2ef54f86cad0cdf812f9cb10bcf3f5d4512015ea9d9c8f8b65ef7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f394b30bd2e8875a67e6e12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你不觉得一旦绑上一字巾\r\n就会想运动吗！我会！！\r\n而且是非常想！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da6ccade0b7e7d1836c25e84ed9b18d455589f3f081b78181153f57896255e9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91f65e389bf8b0e5c208bebc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "班上同学送我肚围当慰劳品。\r\n我真不愧是班长，\r\n声望无远弗届！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a450c2666d1d484046beaa9e4716208cd5667670e1db196caf3dc747916d1d7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93980144d660a3822ae2149f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接住！丢出！奔跑！\r\n然后相信我！如此一来，\r\n一定会获得胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbc6568a4eb6ff631f0aca433b0f9645725375d0997d062123bf3272217ba234",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0126c03b5789655696bc6bd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "躲避球在胜利俱乐部里\r\n也很受欢迎！我的必杀技？\r\n就是「爆进攻击」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1300cf1dd92cb63dd408ee248b0d7161b4c26f81793be9065defaeb26fe04ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1419e841e918aa017f9477d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "长距离也难不倒我的！\r\n总有一天我一定会变得擅长的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4901eb215f7b56d7a5f502b22cc5af1215018a8084ccc7dc52b3e0272b9922f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76068fa298f8b7c1d3ab3539",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いきますッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1a34644b2b48d180e3c7919e4a8c911e526b266d3d0e4f60948bf09a0677d7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56f8f98d6f4b81af16a3ff54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢晴天！\r\n原因是很好跑！\r\n报告内容如上！嗯哼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be1ea27b626087cb9caf9f8b50ae71d43f0281a192f5275da21d3d8b6589a41f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1716de7dde044d5e0984b048",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "速度！爆发力！班长！\r\n集这三点于一身的我，\r\n该先增进哪方面呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48c3a6081dbf167485bca9e5ddbc45d04a4366e8e312313965c366326cdb993c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27610994af952f70f4489d0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爆进！到了训练的时间了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89aea97271d0c7869f75e277793a468b6537e2538934b829c58f4c973ffa187f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79e07ab6e43f701378d811f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经准备好要成为大家的楷模了！\r\n因为我可是班长啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3590fdfcf445fd8d1558e2ea272ac661f90f1837d5ef8b437fab8de1603163fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d4cfff76a06cd14e39f1f72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要训练员和我一起合作，\r\n无论是多艰难的训练，\r\n我都能轻～松克服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86684cccf5472c365df95d6af462f322eb19915e54f936a9268feaa8d0de7918",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ce56aae15da00618274c852",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在抵达尚未有人到达的纪录前\r\n我不会停下脚步的！\r\n爆进、爆进──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0df840b0d62a0ff882f3bb5ee3441ebe3bd45b46f906c2e03c4863204e673ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36fcdf1bd7a9b4a206f7140e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为班长！我一定会\r\n诚心诚意地好好努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfa82c62d7a1d0e1b8d79f6b5fbacac8f7cd109fb73abc202fd0d4aa6e1ad86b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0888ecad670f0cf2382f65d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绑好一字巾，干劲也十足！\r\n我要去卖力──地跑步啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0e98cab0fc9eb78ce35b4de8e90275e760e73ddc0c2aed519172df3d987ab2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:323a5112bfac1831ba5a53b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "换上这身打扮，\r\n让我觉得跳跃力变强了！\r\n我跳！我跳──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "174113b5900c7ba48f847538440517152af1a786f7fe531e42183f73c2afb856",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a423cad9cb30126d912b023",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "魔鬼躲避球跟比赛的道理都一样！\r\n相信我就一定能赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "745ec8dfb2e06cbe0de8dd3e1e7d26fbecbcba9eb54a56a423cee4ca6532fe44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc6fc7697d18cdbd0fa2e4cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "内心和服装都有熊熊燃烧的热情！\r\n这就是班长！\r\n爆进爆进──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8f88fc60fb70251564f2fa4b8f14157fd6c8128c57e658197003b7800433255",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41d7fab693fca8c12f813f0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要我们通力合作，\r\n就一定能抓住胜利！\r\n我这个班长说的准没错！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca3fee15f7794c9d138349cbff8085af01dedf89f549544950c8898ee31959f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39f0f3944c875bbde593153b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辫子的结松掉了！\r\n训练员，我先把头发解开，\r\n麻烦你帮我重新绑好了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23ef4555aece113f30043e5bfbd4f6dbd6ebd9cc1586b6bb0edaac41b0180c75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d4457cb33e9456c619d1f5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，我们走吧！\r\n请你尽管放心相信我！\r\n因为我也信任我们俩！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7278768b6d0fd24b7d86ca44a8b43b5aea2d329b7be608aaed362b48f2bfcc78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4411234352e352dbe7fe9fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和您一起养大的盛开的樱花，是绝不会凋零的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7efeca39c1a0acabe88957e4233ced90b5bb75f4bb22b22b33a19ae4d90bbba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0e5559ac68e19517520746f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼，大家都要继续怀抱理想啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3cac2442abd230d1f57198bebcd66e8a466e4887a0b020ffa3b5b9e665da9db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3637f0243d7bd8b64edf2732",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我们合作获得的胜利！没错！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d07ce740588fc7231a01c1808dd885ce79308d0a86fd4ca68d643034accbafb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53d48d9d0bf67d9bd8450126",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连我自己都觉得这个结果太棒了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2233947a27b5367a9932549965b94c4ef80d3a834c0e6245c0df06db210ef983",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c90ef8c560b795417355839f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来我又要变得更快了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d80db2714165f25436eab6eca267d419f10d0329994069867dfa14766cb13a7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfbedb065339ada2bda49fc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请赐我能赢过任何班长的力量……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "013703367f04f365ec612dacf364238d12b7ffe92a810faa703ee46b35672df5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:293e2bb6f1d696845a0e716d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是，我叫樱花进王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca67650af413f7ffb4ded2effcbe7c26f46e1b5d9ade1038b8b8cc499eae16c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69c89f36d83bcd616934e60b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "支持，我也会优秀地完成！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebed672cbcaf02d785118f7a2b1be61ff022377af6fa5d5996257ed1d2c2773e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3074173053243645ac1f30e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还有班长在您身边！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed31bdc94371aef9e9ed870767c7718f30a178455460f9d42f9f3249881bd955",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fd8f2bfdb2caebb56aee3d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我这个班长……无懈可击！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dd59060374c11f25efca36b82847df4a357c22ed14666adff6603ba5e4c0e16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad205ee4e5c0c8b7c5a21e3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爆进──！\r\n由我来带头迈向胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aab3e0751ecc82c0ac9fb4d1306f26032bbbb6e3ea6811863dc6b3f5e57adc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63ae65be3bd846c29815f6e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来带头迈向胜利吧！\r\n因为我可是班长嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d682700b443b3663cf37a3ca618273afc0be344f39a4bb13869f351b2558441c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd9cc29db25d1204badc0ff2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是樱花进王！\r\n我们一起掌握胜利吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e978a928091448d51a3f34f7f5535234ebfe047463caaa3013a3bc4b412f2cae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fb8d64b662f5b51ec8d97d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，我要上啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3604c1adac25be66b4ba8176bee9bbe87caf466c0729f619139ebf88d882bb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b285fba5d661dcf3e079baf7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能够找到你这颗独一无二的珍珠……\r\n真是最棒的experience！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a71ff245086c3cc8ca71dd366fd07e4e1456ca4a760f546a7d942d1a61ad2c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:307f69e5e04078661c4ba3ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e42824481b89139758cebcbc6de379bc2bfe391af6bc5931ce02cac1bdb2432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5cad2c75dd81904ca2952c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54290808a3e3c1b396c2e16f2fb30f6867b432b72e872ca49eb13fcaa3e944b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e3a6ababe90fdf11484474c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道，\r\n你比谁都更相信我的可能性……\r\n所以你才是best训练员啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "adf051b744d60a822e123236d9e6c98f9ef8d89e6e2c99a3baee51e001e8d87c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8d14834082640e4e11fdef4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次再举办那个special\r\n狂欢节时……规模要大升级！\r\nYes！dancing三天三夜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b66382ade5d03fec68973d36b8f79a33dfd728b960f7eab58d79d3ad52ab6f04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01dc7caf1a48b9b9a65714b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Go to百货公司的新年首卖会！\r\n我要大胆买下衣服的福袋，\r\n不管开出什么衣服我都能驾驭♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "81fb3b9cd493ba340824b3570bfadc63635d77d9ee01dbb642f1910f991bb1a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f24d60aff4dcec9a3dbc1e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年我也四处送出友情chocolates！\r\n而且送的是像我一样发出珍珠光芒的\r\n白松露巧克力喔……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "da0623c34bb4ce0677ffb6c8ea8249fe60a89e7607697ba3c13b5e1b8239f72f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:224725b20ce11ef91b533d5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实……我为你准备了特别的gift。\r\n这是加了爱心形汤料的\r\n特制precious味噌汤……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b42a3c940b2ab57823ee02c9fb72b61150702be2e0cbd904f4c39765b0877b1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6fbbf273db3c474078d71f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚到日本的时候，我还以为\r\n挂签纸的竹子是日式圣诞树呢……\r\n呵呵，真怀念♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3536324c604e8cd3ef5e9f924674500c6448f292f3dd785765ae3cf1f05e6503",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa995f6ee478336b6a944238",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每年都会挑战各种变装喔♪\r\n扮过Mermaid、pirates……\r\n还有牡蛎ghost、昆布shadow……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5ef5c6d1073a9ad9922b67cea9f8f9069d690c7b120ed63a86c3ff1a952f40c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f7252a822fc5faef5cd5b8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "搭着雪橇一个晚上跑遍全世界……\r\n他居然能达成这种不可能的任务，\r\n真是令人不得不respect！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c11f7096c9685fbb9547f9a5afc497bd029be97d3fe299e474f3e2dba73c5a57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdfb6edf1204b7a1f3f668c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在这神圣之夜，让我们边欣赏美丽的\r\n夜景边干杯吧？我手边有款不错的\r\n气泡胡萝卜汁喔……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c25b7c3a35835ce428fe0c3077b8478e9a3074fd069a1c85331d9afe580e0efa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47ed7e16ffe309019efa597c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Victory！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9c462edfc361dbe0ad8cd12fbe53cf8d71c64e729383cc4ee723d054d558d87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1032c4a5696bc796c2f4e64e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的除夕chime也即将来临……\r\n钟声一响我就要跳一段\r\n108beat的chic舞蹈……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aace1985b05b0565717fc718725a236e524a90c92bc0b899a299736ac0f54b50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:239d1f57dae77cd14e241b7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Happy birthday，训练员！\r\n由我代表全世界\r\n为你献上祝福的dance＆sing！",
      "source_fingerprint": "460523c01838de46f2ed29d7b5a955eb6457ff9ad2bc65ecf7fa7f64cc61042d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a1993ae892d3c0ea3cc0469",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我为你准备的生日礼物……\r\n是我这颗宝石绽放出的「光芒」喔！\r\n来吧，专心看着我……",
      "source_fingerprint": "857b5dedf33bcb99fc33e73105643aedebbc7e1aa64afd875cefa1b0a6a033f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c44c15080757888dc921cbdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是什么日子～？没错！\r\n就是硕大珍珠呱呱坠地的日子……！\r\n我听到了……全世界都在为我喝采！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da336fa762f0ce183d6a9aead9dbae01da55d5520e79c938ee0bfb3487f59ce9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee855bcec2ee3623fb94e6ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸妈每年都会送我一颗珍珠。\r\n珠宝盒里的珍珠每年都会随着\r\n我的岁数增加……待会拿给你看喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d64cca836d0ed2108597439eeaf88adcfd9ca3272605a60b24a48bee8641511",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08560aa8df44ff139b92b741",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀？好像收到新公告了！\r\n确认过内容后也tell me吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35f98c525f82c7d9a956e34d0c9924f59acd5ff6db6511587f288a87df1f79cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e748810abf260d8d1d592544",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了呢！\r\n呵呵……盒子里藏着\r\n怎么样的珍珠呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "09da208b2dad2f65952b3d5c72e1a1828227c97b814b4111356dc9924bbccbe4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea4474a6f06d6d9456e78e3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK！Mission clear～！\r\n就照这样成为pioneer吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a144a7abfba4bf54bdbbc4154df307b97e0f0c3ca7c81e093c3d7f586cf43291",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1e5f7dd2dc1c1fbee333913",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说活动就要开始了。\r\n得先做好热身运动才行……♪\r\n喝！One two！One two！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a1b36587533e5dd012e4b138ac154cad420c2c8fca913dbec69396b0ef9fdce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc9b719506565c031c29dc54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目前正在举办special活动！\r\n来吧，let's go！\r\nLet's together～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35c67e4660593a339bd8c0511efb0a3b1826a9808d22ec14640ba6d52b4745d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ee0a868b4a8bd8911d3bd25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "No good……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53152a290e9db819854ea655662d87a0e3fe0a9204e7536e5eb4c947918501f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ed45fbdcc44d803c7d069d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴好像\u0016level up了呢！\r\nAmazing！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10d9d964f2f75532feca31c3a916a0d2da282eb4f284baa2ef9bcdac6583f0d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23dd510db8095ff699a1f0cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ビューリホーセクシーでしょう、\r\n私のファッションセンス。\r\nもちろんパールはネセサリー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58c46bef5fa5eb2726f227d11e077fc3d6dad8bec516d1b69d900e95525b4aa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:896aa1adf20ad7a3b24337d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差し色…それは己のユニークさを\r\nアピールするアイディア。赤…大地\r\nブルー…海、そしてピンクソウル！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ad360181a960a71c7c61f7fa28945d0605e71f2a1ade5d043694b5fd5cc9bde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a303a56cad17afb99bcb2b33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "オフィスカジュアル…いえ、\r\n世界カジュアルと言うべきかしら！\r\nビジネスシーンにもアジャストッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ff965407f45ce0abaea289e051e30f57200ffe1e9f4562734c8bdd220f8a11b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aed478715c9e55d15bb6810",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Uh-huh？不赖嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8be8dfb322a0b656add35c674e33a0baa3350b232d7c2d9fc4926eae42125680",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61f4d777ade4ae9e91a18ff1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对我们来说没有不可能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0542cf49941b9b72e7586ec8d5ad967814bdd80daea670152e5cb1462e68f55f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
